{"node_id": "nd003", "text": "to express gratitude", "depth": 2, "parent_id": "nd001", "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.63, "confidence_raw": 0.63, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000956-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Yeah, thanks.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13}, {"session_id": "p000956-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "But sometimes I just want someone to talk to about it.", "char_start": 65, "char_end": 119}, {"session_id": "p000956-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "It's nice to know there's someone to talk to, but I usually don't seek help unless I really need it. Just having someone to listen helps though.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 144}, {"session_id": "p000956-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "It's reassuring to know there's support here. I appreciate you listening. Sometimes I feel like I have to handle everything on my own.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 134}, {"session_id": "p000956-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "Thanks. It's just that sometimes talking feels like an extra thing to do, you know? Like I already have so much going on.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 121}, {"session_id": "p000956-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "The change keeps things interesting", "char_start": 48, "char_end": 83}, {"session_id": "p000956-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "I like the park by the river and classics like Jane Austen. Haven't settled on a favorite yet, but each one adds something new.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 127}, {"session_id": "p000956-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "Haven't settled on a favorite yet, but each one adds something new.", "char_start": 60, "char_end": 127}, {"session_id": "p000956-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "The busy work schedule has definitely been stressful. I try to take breaks, but it's hard to find time.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 103}], "contradictin